```

**macOS / Linux (bash):**

```bash
echo "[$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')] BUILD COMPLETE -- all tasks done" >> tasks/progress.md
```

```
All tasks complete. Audit complete. Fixed [X] issues.
```
